                title = "4. The Most Beautiful Creations of the Valar: The 2 Trees of Valinor",
                description = "<p>The way Tolkien brings light to his world is extremely unique and highlights the struggle between the powers of good and evil. So what do 2 trees have to do with this? Well, it&#39;s very one of the coolest things he created in his mythology. </p><p>Join our Patreon for weekly bonus episodes, early access, and ad-free listening: <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/lotrlorecast\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/lotrlorecast</a></p><p>Live Shows and game streams:<a href=\"https://app.redcircle.com/shows/2ff6b0e7-2516-44e6-a53c-26f8a68e5565/ep/twitch.tv/robotsradio\" rel=\"nofollow\"> twitch.tv/robotsradio</a></p><p>Talk Lord of the Rings and join the Robots Radio fam: </p><p>Discord: https://discord.gg/tVnB9ce</p><p>Stay plugged in on Twitter: <a href=\"https://app.redcircle.com/shows/2ff6b0e7-2516-44e6-a53c-26f8a68e5565/ep/twitter.com/robots_radio\" rel=\"nofollow\">twitter.com/robots_radio</a> Send me a note! Email: robotsnetwork@gmail.com</p><p><a href=\"http://www.robotsradio.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.robotsradio.net</a></p><br/><br/>Our Sponsors:<br/>* Check out Peace Corps: https://peacecorps.gov/serve<br/>* Check out Quince: https://quince.com/ringslore<br/><br/><br/>Advertising Inquiries: <a href='https://redcircle.com/brands'>https://redcircle.com/brands</a><br/><br/>Privacy & Opt-Out: <a href='https://redcircle.com/privacy'>https://redcircle.com/privacy</a>",
