                description = "<p>Welcome to <em>The Pragmatic Engineer Podcast</em>, hosted by Gergely Orosz, the author of <em>The Pragmatic Engineer</em> newsletter. In each episode, we dive deep into the world of software engineering, offering practical insights on scaling teams, engineering leadership, and navigating the evolving tech landscape. With industry veterans and successful engineers as guests, this podcast is perfect for anyone looking to level up their engineering career with real-world advice.</p><p>Subscribe to the podcast on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pragmaticengineer\">YouTube</a>, on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/2Bho9xCbOQMWMJ7UKmqCzD\">Spotify</a>, or <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-pragmatic-engineer-podcast/id1769051199\">Apple</a>.</p><p>You can also <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.pragmaticengineer.com/\">subscribe to the newsletter here</a>.</p> <br/><br/>Get full access to The Pragmatic Engineer at <a href=\"https://newsletter.pragmaticengineer.com/subscribe?utm_medium=podcast&#38;utm_campaign=CTA_4\">newsletter.pragmaticengineer.com/subscribe</a>",
